      "statement": "A provider advertises start-time features on a static descriptor (SubagentCapabilities: agentOptions, outputSchema, depthLimit, toolFilter, persona) checked by the service before a one-shot run exists; requests needing a missing capability are rejected loud with SubagentError('UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY'), and continuable children are gated by the optional SubagentProvider.prepareContinuable method whose presence is the capability.",
