      "id": "claim_5af0c4389be04534af09a67baa0fbf14",
      "statement": "listOpenDecisions(parent) lists every open decision a continuable child has reported oldest first; open decisions survive the child settling and the durable ledger is folded into the projection on first list so a restarted host reports the same records; resolveOpenDecision(parent, childId, key) closes one open decision idempotently (unknown key returns false without throwing) and appends the durable resolve mutation.",
