      "id": "claim_67e648f72e8e46cb9a53620d2403d3a3",
      "statement": "Provider start() fulfills with a published run: the service mints a unique runId, snapshots local from the provider's exact localAgent, and emits a paired observe-only subagent/start and subagent/end; each continuable Activation emits the same pair for its residency epoch, so a cold resume is a new epoch with its own runId.",
